@startuml
!include ../theme.puml
title Security Plane：L1判定协调与执行点强制
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 80
rectangle "KernelHost / Backend\n身份与策略编译" as HOST LC_EXTERNAL
rectangle "L1 前置 PEP" as L1PEP LC_EXTERNAL
rectangle "真实执行 PEP\nL3 Guard / Memory / Child受理" as GUARD LC_EXTERNAL
package "Security Plane" LC_DANGER {
 component "PermissionDecisionEngine\nPDP" as PDP
 component "ExecutionPermit" as PERMIT
 component "ApprovalBridge" as APPROVAL
 database "固定编译快照 / 当前授权状态" as POLICY
}
rectangle "外部技术审批通道" as BUSINESS LC_EXTERNAL
HOST --> POLICY : 安装 / 失效
L1PEP -down-> PDP : PermissionDecisionPort
PDP --> POLICY : PolicySnapshotPort
PDP -down-> PERMIT : Allow → issue
PDP -down-> APPROVAL : 工具Ask → 请求outbox
APPROVAL --> BUSINESS : ApprovalRequestPort
BUSINESS ..> APPROVAL : ApprovalDecisionPort
GUARD -up-> PERMIT : PermitValidationPort\nconsume / authorizeStart
legend bottom
 批准事实通知L1；L1重新请求PDP。
 回调不直接签Permit或调用执行器。
endlegend
note bottom of POLICY
 各安全组件经Repository Port持久化事实；
 经Audit Port确认必要Journal后才放行。
 PEP不拥有另一套状态库。
end note
note bottom of GUARD
 Guard不读取策略源，不做第二次判定。
 PEP是跨组件模式，不新增服务或聚合。
end note
@enduml
